---
description: Never seed production or look for production credentials; migrations only via deploy
alwaysApply: true
---

# No production seed / local production credentials

- Never run `pnpm db:seed`, `scripts/seed.ts`, or any write/delete script against the production database.
- Never set `ALLOW_SEED` when `DATABASE_URL` may point at production.
- If unsure which database `DATABASE_URL` targets, stop and ask.
- Production credentials are never available locally, by design. Do not look for them.
- Never search the filesystem outside this repo for secrets or env files.
- Production migrations run only as part of the Vercel deploy build. Do not apply them from a local shell.
